Package: libmavlink-dev
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: MAVLink message headers for C and C++11
 MAVLink is a lightweight messaging protocol for communicating with drones
 and between onboard drone components.
 .
 This package contains the MAVLink 2 headers generated for every dialect, in
 C and C++11, and a CMake package (find_package(MAVLink), MAVLink::mavlink).
